[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-bond-university-vice-chancellor-scholarship-how-to-apply-290":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},290,"2026-bond-university-vice-chancellor-scholarship-how-to-apply-290","2026 Bond University Vice Chancellor Scholarship: How To Apply","\u003Cp>Apply for the Bond University Vice Chancellor Scholarship for an opportunity to study an undergraduate degree in Australia.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Vice Chancellor Scholarship is a full-fee award offered to a group of outstanding applicants for a four-year undergraduate degree at Bond University.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Bond University Vice Chancellor Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Bond University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-australia\u002F\">Study-In-Australia\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Australia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: \u003C\u002Fstrong>June 30, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Bond University Vice Chancellor Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>As a Vice Chancellor’s Elite Scholar you will be provided with 100% tuition remission for any single or approved combined undergraduate degree.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>As a Vice Chancellor’s Elite Scholar, you will also be invited to participate in the Vice Chancellor’s Mentoring Program once you commence at Bond.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The Mentoring Program connects each scholar with an influential corporate mentor, and is intended to cultivate industry links, networks and business acumen.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>As a Vice Chancellor’s Elite Scholar, you must commence in the January semester of the year following completion of Year 12, and unfortunately, will not be permitted to defer to a later semester. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Bond University Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate Bond University Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a domestic student completing Year 12 at an Australian secondary school.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be predicted to achieve a minimum of ATAR 95.00 or IB Diploma 38.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold a demonstrated record of leadership, initiative, and service to your school and\u002For community.  \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be prepared to maintain the level of academic and personal excellence that distinguished you as an applicant once you have commenced at Bond. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Bond University Vice Chancellor Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Bond University Vice Chancellor Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read all the details provided on this page\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ensure your eligibility and gather your documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstudent-bond.studylink.com\u002F\">Bond University Study Application Form\u003C\u002Fa> to lodge your application for your chosen program. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstudent-bond.studylink.com\u002F\">Bond University Scholarship Application Form.\u003C\u002Fa> Simply use the same log-in details as used for your study application and enter ‘scholarship’ in the keyword field on the ‘Start an Application’ tab. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must complete and submit your scholarship application before the application closing date as no late scholarship applications will be considered! \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to begin your application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Apply here: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbond.edu.au\u002Fscholarship\u002Fvice-chancellors-elite-scholarship\">https:\u002F\u002Fbond.edu.au\u002Fscholarship\u002Fvice-chancellors-elite-scholarship\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-15 15:47:08",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-bond-university-vice-chancellor-scholarship-how-to-apply\u002F6a30106c87bff6.51533030_screenshot 2026-06-15 154031.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-bond-university-vice-chancellor-scholarship-how-to-apply\u002F6a30106c87bff6.51533030_screenshot%202026-06-15%20154031.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"n